  ('Phase~6 source documents have median', r'''Long inputs are especially important in the last two tasks. Summarization sources have a median length of 17,911 characters, while references have a median of 638 words and a 95th percentile of 2,010. Retrieval queries have median lengths of 4,508, 4,619.5 and 4,653 words in train, dev and test. They average 6.42 and 8.25 relevant cases in train and dev. Candidate lengths exceed 19,000 words at the 95th percentile in every split. Court and date patterns were not analyzed well enough to justify adding temporal features.'''),
